  "description": {
   "en": "It is 1945 in post-defeat Japan. Two young brothers who had been used as test subjects at a human experimentation facility in an extremely cold region escape. The two brothers, who have been subjected to a harsh fate, follow a path to the Antarctic Continent. What is the name of these brothers?!",
